# Pairs with RoleCompilerNeverEmitsScopeless. A scopeless capability in a role ceiling must be dropped, never compiled.
MODULE: AppsCompilerEmitsScopeless
TARGET: RoleCompilerNeverEmitsScopeless
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the role compiler admits a scopeless capability on a data tree
PERTURBS: CompileRoles

--- FIND
    LET admit == o \notin ScopelessOps /\ t \in GrantableTrees
--- REPLACE
    LET admit == t \in GrantableTrees
--- END
